NOTE (RENDER FIX -- unblocked kills!): 2b1e mga blitter needs the real-mode es:di 16-bit fb-SEGMENT WRAP.
The pristine decompile advanced the dst as a HOST POINTER (no wrap), so an off-screen sprite wrote PAST the
64KB fb region in g_mem -- which both SIGSEGV'd (fist_mga.c:7121) AND corrupted adjacent sim state (DGROUP/
object data), BREAKING combat.  Tracking a 16-bit offset that wraps fixes BOTH.  MEASURED: with this + the
077e/op54/442/443 combat stack, AZER1 self-play KILLS enemies -- a296 drops 16 -> 10 (was frozen at 16).
asm-verified vs re_out/fist_mga_image.bin 0x2b1e-0x2ba9.  The OTHER blitters (26de/2660/298a...) very likely
need the same wrap.  Body:

